ofile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20190612144041&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Slightly_Rusted_Shield_5f59ee.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a slightly rusted shield.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 65.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">If you can remove the rust layer and dirt from the shield you will be able to see what it is.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Rust%20Remover\">Flask of Rust Remover</a> on it will remove the rust and uncover a shield. There is a chance the shield will fall apart upon trying to do so. Able to turn into:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Plate Shield</li>\n<li>Ancient Shield</li>\n<li>Norse Shield</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crown%20Shield\">Crown Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Shield\">Vampire Shield</a></li></ul>\n<p>Unrusting Statistics\n</p><p>One can be obtained through the <a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a>.<br/>\nSuccessfully polishing this item will count towards the Polisher achievement.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghulosh\">Ghulosh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gorzindel\">Gorzindel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lokathmor\">Lokathmor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mazzinor\">Mazzinor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Baron%20from%20Below\">The Baron from Below</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Count%20of%20the%20Core\">The Count of the Core</a></li>\n<li><a h